        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electricity, natural gas, at combined cycle plant, best technology</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electricity, natural gas, at combined cycle plant, best technology
Refers to a new combined cycle power plant of 400MWe class. Data of reference power plant: gas turbine 265MWe, steam turbine 140MWe.\nTechnology: Best technology, based on operation data of a German plant built in year 2001. Net efficiency assumed 57.5%.\nVersion: 2.2\nSynonyms: GuD, GCC\nEnergy values: Undefined\nLocal category: Erdgas\nLocal subcategory: Kraftwerke\nUVEK 2022 source file:01375.XML\n\n
Synonyms: GuD, GCC; 
UUID: 5c20cc72-a844-3917-be86-b1c45b58cab4
The module calls the module "natural gas, burned in combined cycle plant, best technology", RER, which in turn includes fuel input from high pressure (RER) network, infrastructure, emissions, and substances needed for operation. The module uses the measured net efficiency of a new 400 MWe combined cycle (CC) power plant in Germany.
Location: undefined
Technology: Best technology, based on operation data of a German plant built in year 2001. Net efficiency assumed 57.5%.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature, operator information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5c20cc72-a844-3917-be86-b1c45b58cab4.xml</text>
